5970                 		.TITLE	Return from Routines in Field 1
5971                 	
5972                 	
5973                 	;   This routine is the other half of the code at PUSHJ1:, and it allows
5974                 	; routines in field one which were called from field zero to return to
5975                 	; field zero.  It only needs to do two instructions, but those instructions
5976                 	; have to be somewhere in field one!
