6813                 		.TITLE	IDE Disk Primary Bootstrap
6814                 	
6815                 	;   This routine will read block zero from IDE disk unit zero into page
6816                 	; zero of field zero of main memory.  The next step in the usual boot sequence
6817                 	; would be to start the secondary bootstrap, but that's up to the caller...
