9040                 	
9041                 	; Mnemonic table. Each entry consists of a mask, a match value,
9042                 	; and a text string in sixbit.  In order to detect the end of the
9043                 	; string, it must be an odd number of characters long so that the
9044                 	; last word is xx00.  .TEXT could have been used, but
9045                 	; it always emits a full word of 0000 and so would have taken more space.
9046                 	
9047                 	; the first 6 groups will always match, so no sentinels are necessary
9048                 	; The Effective Address will be displayed for these
9049                 	OP0:	.DATA	7000, 0000
        21420    7000
        21421    0000
9050    21422        		.SIXBIT	/AND/
